; Focus order, TAB wrapping, DISABLE of the focused control, ENABLE (which
; never moves focus), clicks on disabled and non-control components.
SCREEN 40 3
SET locked 0
BUTTON a 0 0 "A" pa
BUTTON lock 5 0 "Lock" dolock
BUTTON unlock 13 0 "Unlock" dounlock
LABEL info 0 2 "focus moves when a control is disabled"
ON pa PU
ON dolock [DISABLE a DISABLE lock ENABLE unlock SET locked 1]
ON dounlock [ENABLE a ENABLE lock DISABLE unlock SET locked 0]
DISABLE unlock
